Z||000009||Dan||12-04-1999||08:50 AM|||| I have found the way.Interested in my little secret? Tell her it's for the Grandkid.What, no Grandchildren? Tell her you plan on having all your Grandchildren driving a Fiero.Immagine,10-20 years down the road the Grandkids all showing up in Fieros.My three year old Granddaughter loves her car.It is just the right size for her.Grandpa can drive it anytime but Grandma keeps getting in trouble because somehow it leaks out that Grandma has been driving it and she is supposed to wait until they can cruise together.A couple o0f weeks ago the water pump went out and somehow the word got to my Granddaughter that Grandma broke her car.Needless to say Grandma got grounded.Grandma did get permission to drive the car but only for Christmas shopping.Next thing you know, Grandma is out joy riding and is really in the shits now.Don't know how these things keep leaking out.Anyway,it worked for me,and I have four Fieros. ||||reg||10
